# Copy this file to `CNAME` (no extension) when troop2536.org is live.
# A CNAME file in the repo root tells GitHub Pages to serve the site on
# that domain. GitHub Pages then provides free HTTPS automatically.
#
# Also add these records at the domain registrar (full steps in README.md):
#   A     @     185.199.108.153
#   A     @     185.199.109.153
#   A     @     185.199.110.153
#   A     @     185.199.111.153
#   CNAME www   troop2536-mh.github.io
#
# Then update `url` in _config.yml to https://troop2536.org
